    "curated_observations": [
      "Back -> Назад, Cancel -> Адмена (button) / скасаваць (verb), Settings -> Налады (3 contexts)",
      "guide: two senses split — гід (Xbox screen overlay) vs інструкцыя (alignment guide); no entry for the audio-guide sense",
      "unavailable: one identical definition carries two renderings — недаступны and адключаны",
      "download: the same noun appears in two spellings (спампоўванне / спампаванне) in different entries with identical definitions",
      "Downloads Marketplace -> Крама Office: product-name localization, not literal",
      "purchase: no exact entry; compounds give купля / аплаціць; purchaseid untranslated",
      "walk: navigation sense only (walking directions -> указанні для руху пешшу)"
    ]
